l":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=R7FA8M1AHECFP"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=R7FA8M1AHECFP"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=R7FA8M1AHECFP"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=R7FA8M1AHECFP"}]},{"partNumber":"R7FA8M1AHECBD","package":"BGA-224","pins":224,"bodyMm":[13,13],"pitchMm":0.8,"flashKB":2048,"ramKB":1024,"gpio":174,"lcsc":"C19188740","priceUsd":19.14,"priceUsd1k":9.57,"kicad":{"footprintNote":"BGA-224: use the official/vendor footprint","pinout":false},"buy":[{"store":"LCSC","url":"https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C19188740.html","priceUsd":19.14},{"store":"DigiKey","url":"https://www.digikey.com/en/products/result?keywords=R7FA8M1AHECBD"},{"store":"Mouser","url":"https://www.mouser.com/c/?q=R7FA8M1AHECBD"},{"store":"JLCPCB parts","url":"https://jlcpcb.com/parts/componentSearch?searchTxt=C19188740"},{"store":"Octopart","url":"https://octopart.com/search?q=R7FA8M1AHECBD"}]}],"released":2023,"status":"active","datasheetUrl":"https://www.renesas.com/en/document/dst/ra8m1-group-datasheet","productUrl":"https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1","notes":["The maximum CPU clock depends on the package: 480 MHz only on the 224-pin BGA (Tj up to 105 C). It is 400 MHz on the 176/144-pin LQFP and 169-pin BGA, and 360 MHz on the 100-pin LQFP (240 MHz above Tj 105 C).","Two CANFD channels (classic CAN and CAN-FD) on every package. External transceivers are required.","USBHS (480 Mbit/s, on-chip HS PHY, host/device) is only on the 224/169-pin BGA and 176-pin LQFP. The 144-pin and 100-pin LQFP have USBFS only. USB needs VCC of at least 3.0 V.","Two SDHI/MMC hosts and one 10/100 Ethernet MAC (MII/RMII, external PHY). OSPI (xSPI/HyperBus, 2 x 256 MB windows) is on all packages. The SDRAM controller (128 MB window) is only on the 224/176/169-pin packages.","6 SCI channels (UART, simple SPI or simple I2C, shared) plus 2 dedicated IIC, 1 I3C (counted as i2c) and 2 SPI. SSIE (I2S): 2, or 1 on 100-pin.","CEU camera interface: 16-bit on 224/176/169-pin, 8-bit on 144-pin, none on 100-pin. No capacitive touch and no LCD controller (see RA8D1 for graphics).","1 MB SRAM = 896 KB user SRAM + 128 KB TCM. ADC: 2 x 12-bit units with up to 21 distinct inputs on 224-pin BGA and 20 on 176-pin LQFP.","Runs from 1.68-3.6 V and has an optional on-chip DC-DC regulator. Deep Software Standby (mode 3) draws about 1.6 uA typ in DCDC mode.","ROM boot modes: SCI (UART), USB and JTAG (Renesas Flash Programmer)."],"sources":["https://www.renesas.com/en/document/dst/ra8m1-group-datasheet","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1","https://www.renesas.com/en/document/mah/ra8m1-group-users-manual-hardware","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1/part-details/r7fa8m1ahecfc-ba0","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1/part-details/r7fa8m1ahecfb-ba0","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1/part-details/r7fa8m1ahecfp-ba0","https://www.renesas.com/en/products/ra8m1/part-details/r7fa8m1ahecbd-bc0","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C23336746.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C19188768.html","https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/C19188740.html","https://www.mouser.com/ProductDetail/Renesas-Electronics/R7FA8M1AHECBDBC0?qs=HoCaDK9Nz5c4zS%2BN8X4bVA%3D%3D","https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/tree/main/boards/renesas/ek_ra8m1"],"boards":[]}